# Moringa School daily.dev 🚀

An authentic platform designed for students to access verified information, inspiration, and advice within the tech ecosystem. The platform serves as a central hub where the Moringa School community (students, alumni, and tech staff) can consume and create content in the form of videos, podcasts/audio, and technical blog posts.

---

## 🛠️ Project Description & Architecture

The application implements a multi-role ecosystem (**Admin**, **Tech Writer**, **Standard User**):

- **Admin:** Manages user lifecycles, creates content categories, flags/removes policy-violating content, and approves public posts.
- **Tech Writer:** Authors technical content across categories (DevOps, Fullstack, Frontend), moderates published content, and reviews user interactions.
- **User:** Customizes personal feeds by subscribing to categories, creates posts, interacts via Reddit-style nested comment threads, leaves reviews, saves content to wishlists, and receives recommendations.

